            "Пари ознак з |r| > 0.85:\n",
            "citympg     highwaympg   0.972\n",
            "carlength   curbweight   0.875\n",
            "wheelbase   carlength    0.867\n",
            "curbweight  enginesize   0.865\n",
            "carwidth    curbweight   0.853\n",
            "dtype: float64\n",
            "citympg - highwaympg (r = 0.972): видаляємо citympg (|r з ціною| = 0.670)\n",
            "carlength - curbweight (r = 0.875): видаляємо carlength (|r з ціною| = 0.669)\n",
            "curbweight - enginesize (r = 0.865): видаляємо curbweight (|r з ціною| = 0.821)\n",
            "\n",
